%% Phase4 / timeline / G-12 回复列表与话题分支
%% Helix owners: query/render_ready/replies.rs; port_reply/dispatch.rs; event/timeline.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  par reply list snapshot
    UI->>Gate: getReplies({channelId,rootPostId,page})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_get_replies", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
    E->>IM: map command to reply snapshot
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http GET replies(root)
    Host->>Go: HTTP replies page
    Go-->>Host: root + replies + hasMore
    Host->>E: PortReply(reply snapshot)
    E->>IM: correlate req_id
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(reply rows + cursor if needed)
    Host->>DB: durable reply snapshot
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet thread rows
    Host->>DB: readback snapshot
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:thread(projectionMode=snapshot)
  and reply branch append
    UI->>Gate: getReplyBranch({channelId,rootPostId,replyId})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_get_reply_branch", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
    E->>IM: map command to branch
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http GET reply branch
    Host->>Go: HTTP branch page
    Go-->>Host: root + first-level branch
    Host->>E: PortReply(branch)
    E->>IM: correlate branch req_id
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(branch rows + cursor)
    Host->>DB: durable branch write
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet branch rows
    Host->>DB: readback branch
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:thread(projectionMode=append)
  end
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ resolves thread waiters and renders root/replies
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw timeline thread events
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw timeline thread events
  alt HTTP/Persist failure
    IM->>Sink: Emit correlated read error; no partial thread event
  end
  Note over UI,Web: current production PortReply maps reply readback to im:timeline:thread；旧 read relay im:read:result 只作 transport/contract drift 记录，不由 shell 拼字段。
